  faqs: [
    {
      question: 'How much does ecommerce app development cost in Australia?',
      answer: "It depends mostly on whether you extend a platform like Shopify or BigCommerce or build a custom ecommerce platform, and on how many systems (ERP, POS, WMS, carriers, loyalty) need live integration. Extending a platform with custom apps and integrations costs a fraction of building from scratch. Every build starts with our Discovery Audit, a fixed fee credited in full against the build, and you then get one fixed price for the agreed scope. Our app development cost and custom software development cost guides give typical Australian market ranges.",
