      question: 'How is AI used in retail and ecommerce?',
      answer: "Practical uses of AI in retail and ecommerce include product search and recommendations, writing and enriching product descriptions at catalogue scale, customer service assistants that can check order status, demand forecasting for inventory, and triaging returns. The biggest wins usually come from clean product and order data, so we often start with the integration layer before adding AI on top. Anything that changes prices or refunds money should keep a person in the loop.",
