      question: "Should prices in our online store or app include GST?",
      answer: "Yes, for prices shown to consumers. Australian Consumer Law requires a single total price that includes GST and any other compulsory charges, so a store built on US defaults that adds tax at checkout needs changing. From 1 July 2027, per transaction charges such as an online ordering or booking fee must also be shown next to the base price. Your lawyer confirms what applies to you; we build the product pages, cart and checkout to match.",
